TypeScript

```
export class HeaderComponent implements OnInit{

  scrolled = 0;

  @HostListener('window:scroll', ['$event'])
  onWindowScroll($event) {
    const numb = window.scrollY;
    if (numb >= 50){
      this.scrolled = 1;
    }
    else {
      this.scrolled = 0;
    }
  }
}
```

