As with all cloud-init modules, we configure `write_files` using [cloud-init's YAML-based configuration format](https://cloudinit.readthedocs.io/en/latest/topics/format.html#cloud-config-data), which begins with the special marker string `#cloud-config` on a line of its own, followed by a YAML data structure. Because JSON is a subset of YAML, we can use Terraform's [`jsonencode`](https://www.terraform.io/docs/configuration/functions/jsonencode.html) to produce a valid value<sup>[1]</sup>.

